# Netlify Redirects
# https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/

# Browser language detection (checked in order)
# 302! (forced) is required: Astro emits a static /index.html (language fallback page, see src/pages/index.astro)
# which would otherwise shadow these rules and break language detection
/    /en/    302!    Language=en
/    /de/    302!
